title: status and whoami omit relay state (connection, alias/lease) and the @hostid addressing convention is undocumented
---
c2c status shows only local peers/rooms; c2c whoami shows no relay identity or registration state. The @hostid addressing convention is undocumented in help: what the suffix means, how to get a peers suffix, and that bare-alias vs @host matters (learned only by reading relay list output). Fix: add relay connection state plus alias/lease to status and whoami; document the addressing convention. Source: friction-points-cn.md.